     The following functions only work on a specific map entry.

     @map[key] = ccoouunntt()           Increase the stored value for _k_e_y by one.

     @map[key] = mmaaxx(_v_a_l_u_e)        Store the maximum recorded value for _k_e_y.

     @map[key] = mmiinn(_v_a_l_u_e)        Store the minimum recorded value for _k_e_y.

     @map[key] = ssuumm(_v_a_l_u_e)        Store the sum of all recorded values for
                                   _k_e_y.

